  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🔎 準備好探索海洋吧！這次有超多值得觀賞的景色、戰利品、驚喜、生物、結構和考古內容，務必提前做好準備！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧭 在海洋最深處尋找城市，並探索各種不同類型的房間，與各類喪屍魚人對峙。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌊 海洋變得更加有趣，新增了大量小型遺跡甚至化石。祝各位探索順利，這將是一項挑戰！做好準備吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">與世界生成資料包相容，也適用於 Paper/Spigot 伺服器（請務必準備好備份，因為 Paper 偶爾會有 Bug）<br></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>發現問題、提供反饋或協助開發，歡迎加入我們的&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> ，這裡的大家都很友善！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/632622?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">相容平台</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BuWCQzqf/images/ec4c74e592122ec4dba421f0dc6b345351ee9c35.png\" alt=\"Thumbnail\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xtNJCT8.png\" alt=\"pics-from-ocean-mod-jheheh\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcCdBUb.png\" alt=\"pics-from-ocean-mod-jheheh\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><i